            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Moves translucency behind Base's content. Foreground text, navigation, selection, dictation, and composer controls remain solid and plain; supported system themes use native thin material only as the pane backdrop. Super Dark and the disabled setting remain opaque.
